OBSERVATION: This function fetches the CSI driver from a PVC->PV->CSI chain, but it returns empty if the PV is in-tree (no pv.Spec.CSI). This matches the description in the ticket that getCSIFromPVC does not translate in-tree PV to CSI form before checking .Spec.CSI.Driver, which causes failures with CSI migration for in-tree azure-file volumes.
func (p *Plugin) getCSIFromPVC(namespace, claimName string) (string, error) {
	pvc, err := p.pvcGetter.PersistentVolumeClaims(namespace).Get(claimName)
	if err != nil {
		return "", err
